# Shrink a mined place's hour profile by its visit-days before scoring it — the #325 arm for 06-24, measured 2026-09-28 and NOT SHIPPED.
# Apply with: git apply lean/experiments/place-hour-profile-shrink.patch   (against 4806583)
# What it fixes: a place seen on two evenings no longer scores +2.4 nats at 19:00 and out-elects a place 20 m away; 06-24's shop stay elects the near cluster.
# Verdict: 06-18 loses a confirmed walk (the Proton-centre stay then elects the 36-day hospital cluster, shares the first stay's name, and the intra-place absorber merges them) and a journey; 04-30 renames. See task #325.

